      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated US FDIC BankFind Institution & Solvency Risk Auditor Pipeline (Daily B2B M2M Workflow)\n\n**Overview:**\nAudits U.S. FDIC-insured commercial banks and savings institutions via the official FDIC BankFind Suite API. Extracts total assets, deposits, equity capital, ROA, ROE, and calculates counterparty solvency health scores (0-100) for corporate treasury teams.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [b2b-quant-apis/us-fdic-bankfind-institution-financial-auditor](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/us-fdic-bankfind-institution-financial-auditor)\n\n### Quick Setup (2 Minutes):\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your personal token from **Settings -> Integrations**.\n2. Open the **Apify Engine: us-fdic-bankfind-institution-financial-auditor** HTTP Request node and configure a **Header Auth** credential with:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`\n3. Customize the JSON input payload in the HTTP Request node and set your destination Webhook/Slack URL.\n4. Toggle the workflow **Active** to run automatically every morning at 07:00 AM!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "8f1763d0-e3df-5eea-844a-05b2d6aba6ac",
      "name": "Setup Instructions & Architecture",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
